I hereby relieve me or any Dual Crew-Shining member of any responsibilities
due this program. A lot of time and effort went into making this tool as
bug-free as possible, but file-maintenance is a very sensitive matter and
should not be taken lightly. If you are using CD for the first time, I
strongly recommend using the PRETEND mode to get an idea of what is matched
and what isn't. You will get a detailed report in the CD log, but no files
will be harmed or modified.

